{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49765","headline":"渔歌子 一 · 孙光宪","name":"渔歌子 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草芊芊，波漾漾，湖边草色连波涨。\n沿蓼岸，泊枫汀，天际玉轮初上。\n扣舷歌，联极望，桨声伊轧知何向。\n黄鹄叫，白鸥眠，谁似侬家疎旷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孙光宪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49765.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49765","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}